text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nFling deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to any target.", 'Counter target spell.\\nDraw a card.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each card in your hand.', 'Target player sacrifices a creature.', "Target player shuffles up to three target cards from their graveyard into their library.\\nDraw a card.\\nWhen Gaea's Blessing is put into your graveyard from your library, shuffle your graveyard into your library."]
flavor: ['"An angel appeared in the smoldering skies above the fray, her clothes as flames, her armor as fire."\\n—"Hymn of Angelfire"', '"Mold could catch you."\\n—Suq\'Ata insult', '"There is nothing you can do that I cannot simply deny."\\n—Ertai, wizard adept', 'Greven *il*-Vec lifted Vhati off his feet. "The fall will give you time to think on your failure."', "It's raining rats and moggs."]
